window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>In this powerful novel, number-one<i> New York Times</i> best-selling author Danielle Steel tells the story of two World War II concentration camp survivors, the life they build together, and the son who faces struggles of his own as a first-generation American determined to be his own person and achieve success. </p> <p>Moving from the ashes of postwar Europe to the Lower East Side of New York to wealth, success, and unlimited luxury, <i>In His Father's Footsteps</i> is a stirring tale of three generations of strong, courageous, and loving people who pay their dues to achieve their goals.</p>"; 
